1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Hey guys I just parked at a new goodwill so we're going to go thrift again.
大家好，我刚在一家新的Goodwill停车，准备又去淘衣了。

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:12,710
I'm just looking for some fall pieces and I'll put some more of the inspo that I have in mind on screen right now.
我想找些秋季单品，现在把脑海里的穿搭灵感放到屏幕上。

3
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:21,590
But I'm excited to see what we find so let's go.
我很期待看看能找到什么，走吧。

4
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,989
I'm going to head towards the coats first because they're my favorite thing to thrift right now since it's fall.
我先去外套区，因为现在是秋天，外套是我最爱淘的单品。

5
00:00:25,999 --> 00:00:28,120
Coats really just tie together an outfit.
外套真的能把整套穿搭串起来。

6
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:36,640
I spotted my first find really quickly only a minute in but it was this trench coat.
才进去一分钟，我就很快发现了第一件好物，是这件风衣。

7
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:40,640
I really like the peacicoat buttons on it and that it has a belt around the waist.
我喜欢它的纽扣，还有腰部那条腰带。

8
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,000
And the price wasn't too bad.
而且价格也还不错。

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,160
My next find on this rack was this coat.
这个衣架上，下一个收获是这件外套。

10
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:47,919
I really like the burgundy color I feel like it's such a great color for fall.
我很喜欢这个酒红色，感觉特别适合秋天。

11
00:00:47,919 --> 00:00:50,400
And the fit of the coat looked really nice.
这件外套看起来版型也很好。

12
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,480
Continuing down this rack I spotted this denim jacket and I think I could style it well.
继续往下逛，我看到这件牛仔夹克，觉得自己能搭得不错。

13
00:00:54,480 --> 00:01:02,470
But the quality of this was kind of cheap so I decided to pass.
但质量有点廉价，所以决定放弃。

14
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:05,039
Looking back at this clip I love this cordury jacket.
回看这个片段，我真喜欢这件灯芯绒夹克。

15
00:01:05,039 --> 00:01:09,520
It's definitely something that I would usually pick up but when I saw it there was some sort of stain on it.
这本来是我通常会买的款，但当时看见上面有块污渍。

16
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:12,560
You can't even tell in this video but there was definitely a stain.
视频里看不出来，但当时确实有污渍。

17
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:15,920
And so I decided to put it back because I thought I wouldn't be able to get it out.
所以我放回去了，因为以为洗不掉。

18
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:19,679
But now I kind of regret not just trying because this is such a cute jacket.
可现在有点后悔没试试，因为这件夹克太可爱了。

19
00:01:19,679 --> 00:01:24,160
While I was still going through the coats I spotted this minikrt from across the rack.
我还在看外套时，就看见衣架对面有这条裙子。

20
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:27,600
And I actually really like the belt style on it and I think this wash is super pretty.
我很喜欢它的腰带样式，这个水洗颜色也特别好看。

21
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:31,280
Then I started hitting gold first with this beautiful tan leather jacket.
接着我开始淘到宝，先是这件漂亮的棕褐色皮夹克。

22
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,200
I feel like I've never seen anything like it before.
我感觉以前从没见过这样的。

23
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:40,390
I love the sweater details on it and I found out that it is real leather so just such a great find and for 20.
我很喜欢它的毛衣细节，还发现是真皮的，真是好收获，而且只要20。

24
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:45,999
The next thing I found on this same coat rack was this beautiful brown puffer jacket with the fur trim hood.
同一个外套架上，接着找到这件漂亮的棕色蓬松外套，帽子带毛边。

25
00:01:45,999 --> 00:01:52,160
I feel like this is something I'm always in search for especially in this brown color this color is perfect.
我一直想找这样的，尤其是这种棕色，这颜色太理想了。

26
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:57,269
Once I finish with the coat I like to head to the sweaters.
看完外套，我喜欢转去毛衣区。

27
00:01:57,279 --> 00:02:00,080
I thought this one had potential for a cute layering moment.
我觉得这一件能做出很可爱的叠穿效果。

28
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:04,559
I've gotten similar cardigans like this that are short sleeve so I thought why not try a long sleeve one.
我买过类似的短袖开衫，所以想，何不试试长袖呢。

29
00:02:04,559 --> 00:02:09,600
I got so excited about this next one because I love the baby doll cardigan look.
这件让我特别兴奋，因为我很喜欢娃娃款开衫的感觉。

30
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:12,640
And this one had a hood and it's a perfect cream color.
它还有帽子，而且是很理想的奶油白色。

31
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:21,430
I love these toggle buttons as well and siwa as well this is like one of my favorite brands to throw.
我也喜欢这些牛角形扣子，还有那个品牌，也是我很爱淘的牌子之一。

32
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:25,520
I thought this fuzzy cream turtleneck was such a great find.
我觉得这件毛茸茸的奶油白高领毛衣真是淘得值。

33
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:33,119
I mean it looks so soft and it felt so soft and it was 10 so not too bad for a good cozy staple sweater.
它看起来很软，摸着也很软，10块钱买一件舒适基础毛衣不算差。

34
00:02:33,119 --> 00:02:38,720
I love the color on this cardigan I think it's a really great layering piece and the cable knit details are also really cute.
我喜欢这件开衫的颜色，适合叠穿，绞花编织的细节也可爱。

35
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:42,160
But it had a hole in it so unfortunately I did not get.
但上面有个洞，所以很遗憾没买。

36
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:45,680
I've been finding a lot of neutrals but again here's another cream sweater.
找到的多是中性色，不过这里又是一件奶油白毛衣。

37
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,399
I like the quarter zip and it's also really comfy.
我喜欢这个四分之一拉链的设计，而且穿着很舒服。

38
00:02:48,399 --> 00:02:53,759
This next one is definitely a little questionable to the average viewer and it was a little questionable to me.
接下来这件，普通观众可能有点拿不准，我自己也觉得有点悬。

39
00:02:53,759 --> 00:02:56,560
But I really like the buttons so I thought it had potential.
但我很喜欢纽扣，觉得它有潜力。

40
00:02:56,560 --> 00:03:01,039
Then once I put it together I realized it's a cute baby doll style so it could definitely work.
搭在一起后我发现，它是可爱的娃娃款，所以完全可能穿得好看。

41
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:06,479
This one's also a little questionable but I've been liking poncho sweaters recently so we'll see what it looks like in the try on.
这一件也有点拿不准，不过我最近喜欢斗篷式毛衣，试穿看看吧。

42
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:09,670
This zip up would have been so good if it didn't have these elbow patches.
这件拉链衫要是没有肘部补丁就太好了。

43
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:14,720
I'm just not a big fan of them but I really like the waffle knit detail but unfortunately I put it back.
我不太喜欢这些补丁，但喜欢华夫格编织细节，可惜还是放回去了。

44
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:19,839
Yet another cream sweater but this one zipped up all the way and it had a high neck so I really liked it.
又是一件奶油白毛衣，但它能全部拉上，而且是高领，我很喜欢。

45
00:03:19,839 --> 00:03:25,199
After all those cream sweaters I needed a break so I headed to the shoe section for just a quick little glance.
看过这些奶油白毛衣，我想歇一歇，就去鞋区快速扫了一眼。
